WEBVTT

00:08:59.320 --> 00:09:01.936
It was a place where
raw self-expression online

00:09:01.960 --> 00:09:04.376
was rewarded and encouraged.

00:09:04.400 --> 00:09:07.506
It was Leah's job to share
her unfiltered views.

00:09:07.530 --> 00:09:09.236
It was a company standard.

00:09:09.260 --> 00:09:12.038
LF: We felt like we could do
whatever we wanted to

00:09:12.062 --> 00:09:15.516
and people would respond to it.

00:09:15.540 --> 00:09:17.216
AG: And often they would.

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:18.764
The more outrageous the article,

00:09:18.788 --> 00:09:20.124
the more clicks it received,

00:09:20.148 --> 00:09:22.076
the better the website performed,

00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:23.706
and on and on.

00:09:23.730 --> 00:09:27.316
It was a perfect fit
for how Leah saw herself.

00:09:27.340 --> 00:09:31.506
LF: ... a salty bitch
who hated everything